<title>AUSTRIA: SAUDI'S NAIMI ARRIVES IN VIENNA, MAKES NO COMMENT.</title>
<headline>SAUDI'S NAIMI ARRIVES IN VIENNA, MAKES NO COMMENT.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1997-06-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Saudi Arabian oil minister Ali bin Ibrahim al-Naimi arrived in Vienna for this week's OPEC conference but made no comment to reporters.  </p>
<p>Naimi was the fourth OPEC minister to arrive in the Austrian capital. The oil ministers of Iran, Venezuela and the United Arab Emirates arrived earlier today, and the others are expected tomorrow.</p>
<p>The producer group's summer conference is scheduled to open on Wednesday, while the three-man quota compliance committee is set to meet at 1300 GMT on Tuesday.</p>
<p>-- Vienna newsroom +431 713 2002</p>
